  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Experience/BH_Cozy_Experience_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款以舒適為核心的模組包，專為讓你按照自己的步調遊玩而設計。一切都旨在讓世界變得更美好、更舒適，擁有更好的地形、額外的視覺細節、環境音效，以及豐富的建築和裝飾選項。非常適合悠閒探索、打造溫馨家園、農耕、烹飪，純粹享受遊戲而無壓力。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">🔥 <strong>使用 BisectHosting，幾分鐘內就能啟動你的 Minecraft 伺服器！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Experience/BH_Cozy_Experience_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">設定自己的伺服器從未如此簡單。透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>，享受高速、可靠與全天候支援，讓你能與朋友順暢遊玩。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>CRAFTER</strong></span></a> 可享 75 折優惠，立即開始打造你的世界！</span><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Experience/BH_Cozy_Experience_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">這款模組包專為喜歡以平靜舒適方式享受 Minecraft 的玩家打造。得益於 <strong>Terralith</strong>、<strong>Geophilic</strong> 和 <strong>Serene Seasons</strong>，世界生成變得更加有趣且充滿生機；而 <strong>Towns and Towers</strong>、<strong>ChoiceTheorem’s Overhauled Village</strong> 以及 <strong>Moog’s structure mods</strong> 則擴展了探索內容，改善了村莊與建築，同時保持貼近原版風格。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">在日常生活遊戲中，舒適感更是亮點。模組如 <strong>Farmer’s Delight</strong>、<strong>Farm &amp; Charm</strong>、<strong>Bakery</strong>、<strong>Vinery</strong> 和 <strong>Beachparty</strong> 專注於農耕、烹飪與讓生存更放鬆的小細節。至於建築與裝飾，<strong>Macaw’s mods</strong>、<strong>Handcrafted</strong>、<strong>Immersive Furniture</strong> 和 <strong>MrCrayfish’s Furniture</strong> 提供了大量方塊與家具，非常適合打造溫馨房屋、農場和村莊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">此外，遊戲沉浸感透過 <strong>AmbientSounds</strong>、<strong>Sound Physics Remastered</strong>、<strong>Falling Leaves</strong>、<strong>Visuality</strong> 以及動畫模組如 <strong>Fresh Animations</strong> 和 <strong>Not Enough Animations</strong> 進一步提升。搭配 <strong>Sodium</strong>、<strong>Lithium</strong> 和 <strong>Iris</strong>，一切都能順暢運行。這是一款非常適合放鬆、建造美麗事物，以及從容享受 Minecraft 的模組包。</span><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Experience/BH_Cozy_Experience_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1458/938/cozy-experience-2.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1458/939/cozy-experience-3.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1458/